  "ingredients": [
    "1.5 cups all-purpose flour",
    "1 teaspoon baking soda",
    "1 teaspoon baking powder",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "3 bananas, mashed",
    "0.75 cup white sugar",
    "0.33333334326744 cup butter, melted",
    "1 egg, lightly beaten",
    "0.33333334326744 cup packed brown sugar",
    "2 tablespoons all-purpose flour",
    "0.125 teaspoon ground cinnamon",
    "1 tablespoon butter"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C). Lightly grease or line 10 muffin cups with paper liners.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/C4RTZA-SJ96ZRKkixZkGhGGt0cY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/17652-banana-crumb-muffins-ddmfs-4x3-step-Ingredients-ff4352c2e2324446a9ffefd793e5bfac.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17652/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Prepare muffins: Mix flour, baking soda, baking powder, and salt together in a large bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/79zdTiGemDXgCO9zuW79n0Nj9YI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/17652-banana-crumb-muffins-ddmfs-4x3-step-02-f4e171cb92d44453addffacafe0cde83.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17652/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat bananas, white sugar, melted butter, and egg together in a separate bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/PecBiXOFIOdIlp_RMDGMexfnCPw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/17652-banana-crumb-muffins-ddmfs-4x3-step-03-77075984a08c47c3a3be91d8cc7c965e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17652/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir the banana mixture into the flour mixture just until combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ZyxRFh2pG_oC-2G2HRV5u1VjgnA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/17652-banana-crumb-muffins-ddmfs-4x3-step-04-cfbf9b209641455caf964fa7306b676e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17652/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spoon batter into prepared muffin cups, filling each about 3/4 full.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Bq1nX9txngw-ICUxAB6Go5HRAM8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/17652-banana-crumb-muffins-ddmfs-4x3-step-05-d9740ed7e8e147cfa0069b4858854334.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17652/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Prepare crumb topping: Mix brown sugar, flour, and cinnamon together in a small bowl. Use a fork to mix in 1 tablespoon butter until mixture is crumbly; sprinkle topping over muffins.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/TVgmgpmcFJZy3UOnvrgZJobehm4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/17652-banana-crumb-muffins-ddmfs-4x3-step-06-7a67325cb48a4455a01399ab3b888e89.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17652/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until a toothpick inserted into the center comes out clean, 18 to 20 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/OzEWUtK8JJCtNxgeBUhRC-zc6go=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/17652-banana-crumb-muffins-ddmfs-4x3-step-07-06ea3099493647c4ae3caaff14ac7235.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17652/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
